'''Something wicked this way comes!''' are [[Achievement]]s introduced to the PC version in [[Booster Pack #5]] and earlier in the Switch release of [[Afterbirth †]] that unlocks after [[??? (Boss)]] has been defeated three and six times with different characters. They unlock main path bosses that were introduced in and originally unlocked by default in [[Afterbirth]] and [[Afterbirth †]], {{dlc|r}}and were extended to include main path bosses introduced in [[Repentance]].

== Something wicked this way comes! ==
These bosses unlock after defeating [[??? (Boss)]] with three different characters.
