== Trivia ==
* The Something Wicked This Way Comes quote is most likely a reference to the same quote from one of the witches from Shakespeare's play "Macbeth." It may also be a reference to the Ray Bradbury novel of the same name, which in turn, is also a reference to Macbeth.
* {{plat|PS4}} {{dlc|a+}} Achievements 340-348 don't exist in the PS4 version, resulting in the content already being "unlocked" even on new save files.
* These achievements existed in earlier versions of the Switch release, but were ported to PC after popular demand.

